{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"В Domovoy есть три наблюдаемых слоя памяти: краткосрочная, рабочая и долговременная.","evidence":[{"chunk_id":"d20a761ce30ab2987eb6a1b30c395896f9a23180f867aa9d51f1e876e4912ad2","quote":"Domovoy exposes three observable memory layers:

- **short-term** — the current chat transcript (never rewritten by memory);
- **working** — confirmed records owned by the current project;
- **long-term** — confirmed records shared across projects by the local user."}]},{"text":"Краткосрочная память относится к текущему чату (сессии).","evidence":[{"chunk_id":"1b3f9da7973bf3be6a0a3561a9e1e282daa4b81632b4a81cbbb0b2605af322ca","quote":"| Short-term | `AgentTranscript` | session | current chat |"},{"chunk_id":"3efa4a4b271284f812c712d96c35176001484d0fc2a5a2d1857da46537e86391","quote":"| Short-term | `AgentTranscript` | current chat | until compaction/chat deletion |"}]},{"text":"Рабочая память принадлежит текущему проекту.","evidence":[{"chunk_id":"1b3f9da7973bf3be6a0a3561a9e1e282daa4b81632b4a81cbbb0b2605af322ca","quote":"| Working | working JSONL | project | until edited, forgotten, or project deletion |"},{"chunk_id":"3efa4a4b271284f812c712d96c35176001484d0fc2a5a2d1857da46537e86391","quote":"| Working | `memory-v1_` JSONL | current project | until edited, forgotten, or project deletion |"}]},{"text":"Долговременная память является глобальной для локального пользователя и разделяется между проектами и чатами.","evidence":[{"chunk_id":"1b3f9da7973bf3be6a0a3561a9e1e282daa4b81632b4a81cbbb0b2605af322ca","quote":"| Long-term | long-term JSONL | local user/global | across projects and chats |"},{"chunk_id":"3efa4a4b271284f812c712d96c35176001484d0fc2a5a2d1857da46537e86391","quote":"| Long-term | `memory-v1_` JSONL | local user | across projects and chats |"}]},{"text":"Рабочие записи требуют проекта, а долговременные — глобальны для пользователя; при извлечении они не смешиваются.","evidence":[{"chunk_id":"3efa4a4b271284f812c712d96c35176001484d0fc2a5a2d1857da46537e86391","quote":"Working records require a project; long-term records are user-global. Retrieval
never mixes them: a working record is only ever returned for its own project."}]}]}

evidence.quote:
Domovoy exposes three observable memory layers:

- **short-term** — the current chat transcript (never rewritten by memory);
- **working** — confirmed records owned by the current project;
- **long-term** — confirmed records shared across projects by the local user.

